   "text": "Two Kaldheim Commander decks are released together with Kaldheim . These are meant to be on-ramps to Commander , with a few new cards (eight per deck) and the rest reprints.",
   "scene": 0,
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "There are 16 new cards (with printed set code KHC and collector numbers #001–016) printed in the Kaldheim Commander Decks, more than in the decks from Zendikar Rising or Commander Legends ones (14 rares, 2 mythic rares) . These cards are legal for play only in the Commander , Vintage , and Legacy formats. The other cards in these decks (with printed set code KHC and collector numbers 017–119) are legal for play in any format that already allows those cards; that is, appearing in these decks doesn't change a card's legality in any format.",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "Description"
  },
  {
